<title>USA: Minolta launches line of desktop printers.</title>
<headline>Minolta launches line of desktop printers.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minolta Corp, a unit of Minolta Co Ltd, on Monday unveiled its first branded line of laser printers, introducing a new line of monochrome and color desktop models with street prices ranging from $319 to $2,999.</p>
<p>The PageWorks family of printers includes five models, with page-per-minute speeds ranging from six pages to 20 pages. The full-color unit produces 12 monochrome pages per minute and three full-color pages per minute.</p>
<p>Although Minolta has supplied printers for more than a decade, it said Minolta PageWorks is its first branded line.</p>
</text>
